  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Infantilization",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Black children are cognitively incapable of understanding or following basic instructions, thereby infantilizing them and devaluing their intelligence. This is a form of racialized mockery that implies Black children are 'foolish' or 'dumb' simply because of their race, which is a core component of anti-Black racism.",
